msgstr "`근거 S142 <https://english.shanghai.gov.cn/en-Latest-TalentsinShanghai/20260202/3c543c31bce34e1b9e2bc5615a63d2df.html>`_. Guide for foreign talent and team members (Category A/B) applying for a Foreigner's Work Permit during the startup phase_Latest."

